---
import InfoLayout from '../../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---
<InfoLayout
  title="Garden Room Landscaping | Decking, Paths & Garden Design | The Green Rooms"
  description="How to landscape around your garden room — decking, paths, planting and access. What we can include and how to plan the surroundings of your new build."
  canonical="/your-build/landscaping"
  pageTitle="Landscaping"
  pageSubtitle="How the space around your garden room is finished matters almost as much as the room itself."
  heroImg="/images/GR%20decking.webp"
  heroAlt="Garden room with composite decking in a Surrey garden"
  breadcrumb={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Your Build', href: '/your-build/build-process' }, { label: 'Landscaping' }]}
>
  <section style="background:#fff; padding:72px 0;">
    <div style="max-width:840px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px;">
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:32px; margin-bottom:48px;">
        {[
          {
            title: 'Decking',
            available: true,
            body: 'We can add external composite decking to your build as part of the overall project. Composite decking uses the same technology as our cladding — it looks like real timber but requires zero maintenance and won\'t rot or warp. A 3m × 2m deck in front of bifold doors significantly extends the usable space in summer and makes the room feel much more connected to the garden.',
          },
          {
            title: 'Access Path',
            available: true,
            body: 'A clear, level path between your house and the garden room makes a difference to daily use — especially in wet weather. We can advise on materials and connect you with landscapers we\'ve worked with. Gravel, porcelain paving and resin-bound paths are all popular choices.',
          },
          {
            title: 'Ground Screw Advantages',
            available: true,
            body: 'Because we use ground screw foundations (not concrete), the ground around and under the room is largely undisturbed. Plants and grass recover quickly after the build, and there\'s no large concrete slab to deal with if you ever want to relocate or remove the building.',
          },
          {
            title: 'Planting',
            available: false,
            body: 'Garden planting design is outside the scope of what we provide — we\'re carpenters, not gardeners. What we can do is ensure the building is positioned to allow planting access on all sides, and we\'ll avoid placing ground screws where they\'d obstruct established root systems.',
          },
          {
            title: 'Lighting Paths',
            available: true,
            body: 'External LED path lights can be added to the electrical installation — low-level ground lights or spike-mounted post lights that run off your garden room consumer unit. A good solution for walking to the room in the dark in winter months.',
          },
        ].map(s => (
          <div style="padding-bottom:28px; border-bottom:1px solid #ebeced; display:flex; gap:16px;">
            <div style={`width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background:${s.available ? '#34a02e' : '#ccc'}; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:6px;`}></div>
            <div>
              <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:8px;">
                <h3 style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#2d3841; margin:0;">{s.title}</h3>
                <span style={`font-size:11px; font-weight:700; padding:2px 10px; border-radius:50px; ${s.available ? 'background:#e7f1e3; color:#34a02e;' : 'background:#f3f4f0; color:#888;'}`}>
                  {s.available ? 'We can help' : 'Outside our scope'}
                </span>
              </div>
              <p style="font-size:14px; color:#555; line-height:1.85; margin:0;">{s.body}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:12px; margin-bottom:32px;">
        <div style="border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; height:200px;"><img src="/images/GR%20decking.webp" alt="Garden room with composite decking" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div style="border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; height:200px;"><img src="/images/GR%20extended%20height%20with%20thermo%20ayous%20cladding%20and%20millboard%20decking%20opposite%20angle.webp" alt="Garden room with millboard decking" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div style="border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; height:200px;"><img src="/images/classic%20GR%20with%20storage%20and%20decking.webp" alt="Garden room with storage and decking" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#34a02e; border-radius:20px; padding:28px; text-align:center;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin:0 0 10px;">Discuss Your Landscaping Plans</h3>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin:0 0 16px;">Bring any landscaping ideas to your free site visit — we'll tell you what we can include in the build and what's best handled separately.</p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-white" style="font-size:14px; padding:12px 24px;">Book a Free Site Visit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InfoLayout>
